 JavaScript frontend, using WebSockets to enable real-time multiplayer communication and gameplay. It also includes player management, matchmaking, and tournament functionality.","conclusion":"Built and delivered a complete real-time multiplayer platform, combining backend architecture, WebSocket communication, interactive game logic, and responsive frontend experiences.","thumbnail":{"src":"/images/pong/pong thumbnail.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena project thumbnail"},"heroImage":{"src":"/images/pong/pong thumbnail.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena project hero preview"},"coverImage":{"src":"/images/pong/Create_a_mockup_2k_202602141753.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena project showcase"},"images":[{"src":"/images/pong/pongarena1.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena project showcase image 1"},{"src":"/images/pong/pongarena1.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena project showcase image 2"},{"src":"/images/pong/Create_a_mockup_2k_202602141751.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena project showcase image 3"}],"services":["Full Stack Development","Django Backend","JavaScript Frontend","WebSocket Architecture"],"serviceSlugs":["django-python-development","web-application-development"],"client":"42 Network / Open Source","website":"https://github.com/oelbouha/ft_transcendence","tags":["Django","JavaScript","WebSockets","Full Stack"],"link":"https://github.com/oelbouha/ft_transcendence","quote":"A complete real-time multiplayer experience combining solid backend architecture with responsive gameplay.","quoteAuthor":"42 Network","quoteRole":"Open Source Community"},"nextProject":{"slug":"habivio","title":"Habivio","category":"Mobile UX & Product","year":"2025","tagline":"Mobile habit tracker & wellness interface built for daily engagement.","description":"A sleek habit tracking and personal wellness iOS & Android app built with React Native and modern micro-interactions.","overview":"Habivio is a mobile wellness platform designed to turn positive daily rituals into lasting habits. Featuring intuitive progress rings, streak analytics, and besp